  <x:String x:Key="settings.window.title">TransDuck Settings</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="settings.heading.provider">Translation provider settings</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="settings.description.credential">When a provider uses a credential, it is stored only in protected storage for the current Windows user and is never shown or refilled after saving. Volcengine requires both an AccessKey ID and Secret Access Key. Google Translate web does not use a credential. A Bing Cookie is optional.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="settings.heading.sources">Results to show</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="settings.description.sources">Enable one or more configured translation providers. Each enabled source is queried concurrently and shown separately.</x:String>
